<h4 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Antennas Appear to be Made in China by CaddxFPV</h4>



<p>Red Cat also posted a <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/red-cat_red-cat-holdings-introduces-fang-a-low-cost-activity-7381720138556932096-Gz3G?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAACybcoABOlxReNjUmQm1aFHkYJbSezsaHSk">promotional video</a> on Oct.8 that showed a FANG with what appears to be a Chinese made antenna.</p>


